  "_note": "Example only. Set STEALTH_PROVIDER_CONNECTIONS_FILE to a copy with real provider model ids and prices. Keys stay in env vars (credential_ref), never here. Every compliance flag is a declaration: confirm it against the provider's own terms and a signed DPA before setting it true. Leave a flag out when unknown.",
